      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A multi-unit residential investment opportunity.\r\nComprising 2 x Pre-63 mid terrace properties with 10 units in total. \r\nRanging in size from approximately 18 sq. m (194 sq. ft) - 64sq. m (689 sq. ft).\r\nExtending to approximately 376 sq. m. (4,048 sq. ft.) in total. \r\nHighly sought after location within walking distance of the Portobello, Dublin City Centre and a host of amenities. \r\nSituated 350 metres from Griffith College Dublin. \r\nAll units are tenanted with a combined total rental income of 215,364\r\nReversionary Potential. \r\nGross Yield of 8.29% \r\n\r\nThe properties are both arranged over the ground, first and second floors to provide 2 x mid-terrace Pre-63 properties. Internally, the properties are arranged to comprise 5 x units in No. 15 and 5 x units in No. 16.   Ideally located within walking distance of both Portobello and Dublin City Centre, the property enjoys access to a wide range of retail, dining, leisure and community amenities.The location benefits from excellent connectivity, with numerous Dublin Bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin city centre. Situated approximately 350 metres away from Griffith College Dublin and 1.2km from St. James Hospital."
